  m_Name: DreadCaptain
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: OneMoreKnight::OneMoreKnight.Enemies.EnemyStats
  maxHealth: 30
  moveSpeed: 1
  scoreValue: 800
  contactDamage: 2
  description: The host's field officer, greatcoat still dripping from a sea nobody
    here has seen. The hand-cannon was against regulations. So was coming back.
  tactics: 'A 30-HP MINIBOSS (tracked bar) firing telegraphed aimed triple-volleys
    in bursts of three. The volleys converge on your position - strafe THROUGH them,
    not away. Its slow march gives you time; its escort usually does not. Priority:
    escorts first, then the grind - it always drops a sword.'
